<view class="screen"><view class="hero page-scene-conversation"><image class="hero-art page-scene-image" src="../../assets/page-scenes/voice.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="hero-copy"><view class="hero-brand"><image src="../../assets/chengzi-orbit.png"/><text>成子 · 实时语音</text></view><text class="title">有话，就直接说。</text><text class="sub">最多聊 3 分钟，可以随时插话。</text></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{phase === 'idle'}}" class="mode-card"><text class="mode-title">收听方式</text><view class="mode-options"><button class="mode-option {{audioMode === 'speaker' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="speaker" bindtap="selectAudioMode">手机免提<text>免提对话 · 可插话</text></button><button class="mode-option {{audioMode === 'headphones' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mode="headphones" bindtap="selectAudioMode">已戴耳机<text>推荐 · 稳定双工</text></button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{phase === 'idle'}}" class="mode-card"><text class="mode-title">这次想聊谁？</text><picker range="{{people}}" range-key="label" value="{{personIndex}}" bindchange="personChange"><view class="memory-select">{{people[personIndex].label}}　⌄</view></picker><text class="hint">{{memoryHint}}</text><checkbox-group wx:if="{{people[personIndex].id}}" bindchange="memoryAgree"><label class="consent memory-consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{memoryAgreed}}" color="#965a42"/><text>同意本次参考所选人物档案。</text></label></checkbox-group></view>
<view class="status-card"><view class="pulse {{phase === 'talking' ? 'live' : ''}}"><image src="../../assets/ui-audio.png"/></view><text class="status">{{status}}</text><text class="hint">{{phase === 'talking' ? (audioMode === 'speaker' ? '正在过滤播放回声，识别到你的发言后回应' : '耳机双工：可边听边说；结束通话即停止传输') : '按下开始后，微信会请求麦克风权限'}}</text></view>
<view wx:if="{{you || assistant}}" class="transcript"><view wx:if="{{you}}" class="line"><text class="speaker">你</text><text>{{you}}</text></view>
<view wx:if="{{assistant}}" class="line"><text class="speaker">军师</text><text>{{assistant}}</text></view></view>
<checkbox-group wx:if="{{phase === 'idle'}}" bindchange="agree"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#965a42"/><text>我同意本次麦克风音频、即时转写及所选人物档案交由阿里云百炼生成回应；结束通话即停止传输，不自动写入档案。</text></label></checkbox-group><view wx:if="{{phase === 'idle'}}" class="billing-note"><text class="billing-title">这通如何计费</text><text>点开本页不扣积分。开始连接时暂留 20 积分；军师开始语音回答后才计入已使用。连接失败或未生成语音回答，积分自动退回。</text></view>
<button wx:if="{{phase === 'talking' || phase === 'connecting'}}" class="end" bindtap="end">结束通话</button><button wx:else class="start" bindtap="start">开始语音对话</button><view wx:if="{{error}}"><text class="error">{{error}}</text><button class="fallback" bindtap="openText">改用打字咨询 →</button></view><text class="privacy">离开页面会结束通话。</text></view>
